<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period April 14-20 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		    Apr 14-20   April 15-21     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		     1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    329,993.6   361,241.5</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  16,040.1    19,521.0     931,712.5    770,330.1</p>
<p> Home Market	  335.5	 357.7	13,796.7     15,664.1</p>
<p> Stocks/close   313,618.0   341,362.8</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
